Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Piano music plays
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.76,0:00:33.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.74,0:01:36.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Mom, please buy me a gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.58,0:01:38.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, what do you call\Nthat thing in your hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.76,0:01:40.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean a real one.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.50,0:01:42.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not old enough, Tawness.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.66,0:01:43.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.98,0:01:46.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll clean out the Thomas coop every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.72,0:01:48.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Mom, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.04,0:01:51.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be careful, I promise. Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.02,0:02:33.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.44,0:02:39.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha, ha, ha, ha, ha...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.08,0:02:51.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha, ha, ha...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.64,0:02:58.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vash the Stampede, the Humanoid\NTyphoon... ...taken down in Inepril City.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.18,0:02:59.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice headline.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.80,0:03:05.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The 60 billion double dollars is ours!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.90,0:03:07.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so excited I can shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.16,0:03:09.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not only are we disgustingly rich,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.94,0:03:12.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we're going to be famous\Nacross the entire galaxy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.72,0:03:15.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're acting awfully cautious.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.98,0:03:17.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's okay, he's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.32,0:03:20.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't help it, it's him lying there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.38,0:03:25.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, cheer up, you look so depressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.06,0:03:27.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is a great day for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.72,0:03:31.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With what we just earned, we can have\Nthis restaurant rebuilt if you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.70,0:03:32.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you mean it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.61,0:03:34.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn straight, sweet cheeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.24,0:03:37.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Me and my esteemed partners\Nhere are multi-billionaires now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.26,0:03:39.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm so relieved.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.68,0:03:41.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was very worried about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.56,0:03:44.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You reek of tomatoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.66,0:03:46.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.58,0:03:49.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I was trying to run away,\Nit got dumped all over me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.30,0:03:52.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, would you mind reimbursing\Nme for my dry cleaning?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.72,0:03:54.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll reimburse you, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.52,0:03:58.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With a one-way ticket to the pearly gates!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.02,0:04:07.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're so impatient.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.50,0:04:09.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, why do you have to be in such a rush?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.48,0:04:10.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's just talk it over.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.92,0:04:12.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who the heck are you, mister?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.04,0:04:16.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I get so embarrassed when\NI have to introduce myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.82,0:04:19.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But since you were asked,\NI'm like a hunter of peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.54,0:04:22.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One who chases the elusive mayfly of love.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.38,0:04:23.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.78,0:04:27.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, kill that motherfucker!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.78,0:04:28.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you insane?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.76,0:04:31.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you want to die stupid?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.20,0:04:32.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He just shot us all!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.30,0:04:33.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Next time he might use real bullets!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.06,0:04:35.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's okay, shoot if you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.66,0:04:36.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Try your luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.24,0:04:38.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.15,0:04:38.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't provoke him!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.07,0:04:39.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't provoke him, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.98,0:04:40.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Potter!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.89,0:04:44.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.70,0:04:49.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With the exception of this guy, I'm afraid\Nyou've used up all your bullets already.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.06,0:04:51.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.72,0:04:52.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could you tell?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.70,0:04:53.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I counted.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.24,0:05:01.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gee, I really hope it's\Nnot cold outside for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.52,0:05:04.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here's your gun, partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.80,0:05:05.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It really helped.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.96,0:05:07.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.38,0:05:11.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was quite impressive, young man.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.80,0:05:13.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A dangerous situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.44,0:05:16.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you always survived like\Nthat without shooting anyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.42,0:05:17.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because it's too wasteful.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.84,0:05:19.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all, I can come into\Na restaurant like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.74,0:05:21.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and order an entire stack of pancakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.32,0:05:23.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,for the price of one silly bullet.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.32,0:05:24.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are a strange one.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.10,0:05:28.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seems very odd that you\Nconsider yourself a gunman.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.26,0:05:29.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got a point there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.88,0:05:37.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm very sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.78,0:05:38.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.86,0:05:42.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I really hate to do this,\Nson, but you are Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.96,0:05:44.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vash the Stampede, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.06,0:05:45.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.97,0:05:46.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.89,0:05:48.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please die without the fuss, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.64,0:05:51.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry about this, Mr. Vash, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.00,0:05:54.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey. No biggie.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.96,0:06:00.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my gosh.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.02,0:06:02.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Half the city is buried in sand.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.58,0:06:06.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Their plant probably broke\Ndown and stopped working.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.26,0:06:09.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, then they should fix it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.46,0:06:13.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you have any idea how much repairs\Nto a plant that size can cost?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.30,0:06:14.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why? Is it expensive?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.20,0:06:21.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This time it looks like\Nthe rumors are true.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.10,0:06:25.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're smiling, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.96,0:06:27.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am not smiling.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.90,0:06:31.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now we have to go run risk\Nprevention and get this documented.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.18,0:06:35.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This time we will find the real Vash the\NStampede and bring about his downfall.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.12,0:06:40.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can this be the end?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.50,0:06:44.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There he is! In here! Oh crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.54,0:06:47.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.26,0:06:50.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's him!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.17,0:06:52.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got you now! Oh\Nreally? Do you mean me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.20,0:07:03.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone's so busy today!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.48,0:07:07.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mama, why does this keep happening to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.48,0:07:08.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I haven't done anything wrong,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.58,0:07:10.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I'm always in trouble and\Neverybody's always picking on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.90,0:07:11.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do I do, Mama?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.81,0:07:12.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.48,0:07:15.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why am I crying in French?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.86,0:07:18.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.77,0:07:19.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.12,0:07:21.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's all mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.62,0:07:25.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get me out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.40,0:07:28.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.44,0:07:31.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like things are getting\Npretty heated up down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.14,0:07:35.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to do something before the entire\Ncity and everyone in it is blown away.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.52,0:07:39.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if they're this agitated, I\Nwonder if it really might be him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.20,0:07:42.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's stop this now. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.46,0:07:43.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait a minute, Meryl.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.90,0:07:44.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.38,0:07:46.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Meryl!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.00,0:07:48.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.50,0:07:52.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.41,0:07:53.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I like it so bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.72,0:07:55.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't stand it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.02,0:07:56.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.93,0:07:58.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who's that deal with\Nhis use of the grenade?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.74,0:08:02.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He can't be identified for the reward\Nif he's a pilot car, you dumbass!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.58,0:08:03.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.49,0:08:04.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,People out of control.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.62,0:08:05.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Complete mayhem.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.26,0:08:08.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Attention! Excuse me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.44,0:08:12.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you'll just listen to your mind,\NI'm very sorry to disturb you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.06,0:08:16.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name is Meryl Stryfe from the\NBurner Daily Insurance Society,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.38,0:08:17.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I'm here to stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.22,0:08:20.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The man you're well after,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.76,0:08:24.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the one who's known as Bash the\NStampede, is a very dangerous man.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.34,0:08:26.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In order to protect your\Nprecious lives and all
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.52,0:08:29.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of your valuable possessions\Nfrom any further home.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.30,0:08:31.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is a message from Mission Control.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.30,0:08:35.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Temporarily suspend all\Npursuits of Bash the Stampede.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.74,0:08:37.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everybody proceed to base at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.54,0:08:39.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ugh, temporarily?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.08,0:08:41.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell's the matter with them?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.80,0:08:43.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop all pursuit now!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.62,0:08:47.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, what are we supposed\Nto do now, Chairman?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.06,0:08:51.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The damage and casualties are\Njust getting worse by the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.04,0:08:56.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I cannot believe we still haven't caught\Nthis guy after four hours of fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.18,0:08:57.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Caught him?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.09,0:08:58.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The guy's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.40,0:09:01.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's managed to run away without\Nreturning a single bullet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.40,0:09:03.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's just too good for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.20,0:09:05.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we make him mad, there's no telling.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.52,0:09:08.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chairman, perhaps we should stop this\Nwhile the city is still standing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.02,0:09:10.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That goes without saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.50,0:09:13.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where can I find the man in charge?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.28,0:09:14.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need to speak to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.30,0:09:15.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And just who are you people?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.22,0:09:17.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me see the man in charge!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.56,0:09:21.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can you allow this to happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.34,0:09:22.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is an outrage!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.64,0:09:25.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't possibly take\Nout the humanoid typhoon,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.34,0:09:28.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,no matter how many thousands\Nof people you set on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.12,0:09:30.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, yes, I know that\Nthe risk is very high.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.70,0:09:35.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But, Miss, you must understand that we\Nreally need that $60 billion double dollars.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.60,0:09:38.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's for the plant, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.52,0:09:40.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.52,0:09:45.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because of a support system bug, over\Nhalf of the plant is completely unusable.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.12,0:09:46.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if you mess with Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.72,0:09:48.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vash and the entire city gets wrecked,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.48,0:09:51.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you're going to have a lot more\Nthan just the plant to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.38,0:09:52.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.80,0:09:54.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It may already be too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.14,0:09:57.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought we should fight fire with fire,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.24,0:09:59.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so that's when I called\Nin our last resort.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.16,0:10:01.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And, sir, just what is our last resort?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.94,0:10:03.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm, that. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.94,0:10:17.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.22,0:10:19.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all over.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.16,0:10:26.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can somebody tell me who or what that is?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.98,0:10:28.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the Nebraska Family!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.20,0:10:31.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, who's the idiot\Nthat parked this car here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.32,0:10:34.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you trying to make\Nmy son trip or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.84,0:10:35.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, you heard him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.88,0:10:38.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Move it now, you damn ignorant drivers.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.46,0:10:40.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me borrow that thing right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.84,0:10:43.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nebraska family, what are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.18,0:10:46.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Both of you are supposed to be\Nserving a jail term of 700 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.46,0:10:47.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut your stinking trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.04,0:10:50.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We released ourselves yesterday\Nat our own discretion.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.88,0:10:52.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That, that is called a jailbreak.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.92,0:10:55.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gee, that's too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.46,0:10:57.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I was getting quite\Nfond of the quiet life.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.48,0:10:58.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But then again,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.18,0:11:03.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,who can lie idle knowing that 60 billion\Ndouble dollars is there for the taking?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.72,0:11:05.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't that right, Gofsef?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.94,0:11:10.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The infamous Nebraska family.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.28,0:11:14.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Convicted felons of over\N150 Class A offenses and...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.84,0:11:18.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me you're not gonna stick that\Nbig oaf on Vash the Stampede now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.64,0:11:21.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, it seemed like a\Ngood idea at the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.68,0:11:23.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm sick of this!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.16,0:11:25.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why does every situation we run\Ninto take the worst possible turn?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.94,0:11:27.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't stand it anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.48,0:11:30.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We caught Sammy the Stampede! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.94,0:11:34.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Down here, I said we caught\NVash the Stampede! Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.00,0:11:38.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like I said before, we\Ncaught Vash the Stampede!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.58,0:11:40.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you mean you really caught him?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.38,0:12:00.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, maybe they've decided\Nto give up after all, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.88,0:12:05.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.79,0:12:06.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.18,0:12:08.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.24,0:12:09.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't move, Mr. Vash!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.80,0:12:14.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? Uh-oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.52,0:12:16.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Sandy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.43,0:12:18.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go tell Control that we've caught him!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.10,0:12:19.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've caught Vash the Stampede!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.66,0:12:20.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell them to hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.57,0:12:21.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.49,0:12:22.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be quick now!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.20,0:12:26.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bounty hunters in aprons?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.42,0:12:30.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't want children to see this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.68,0:12:32.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.76,0:12:34.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't want them to see this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.68,0:12:36.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we have no other choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.44,0:12:37.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We desperately need money.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.96,0:12:39.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have a son lying sick at home,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.10,0:12:44.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but the town doctor decided to take\Noff and abandon this dying city.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.08,0:12:46.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know what's wrong with my boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.20,0:12:48.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't just stand back and wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.58,0:12:50.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no one left to help him here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.36,0:12:52.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why, that's why I...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.66,0:12:56.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The people, the land, everything went\Nwrong after the plant malfunctioned.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.70,0:13:00.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But not everyone is rich enough\Nto leave this damned city.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.20,0:13:02.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need money to call the\Nengineers to fix the plant.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.02,0:13:05.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unless it's repaired,\Nthe city is finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.68,0:13:07.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Along with everyone in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.56,0:13:11.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only one person has to\Ndie to save this city.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.64,0:13:12.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So please, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.08,0:13:14.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vash, give yourself up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.50,0:13:17.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please don't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.00,0:13:23.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I understand your situation\Nbetter than you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.70,0:13:28.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However… No! Please, sir! Don't do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.06,0:13:34.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Until I see this man you're after,\NI have no choice but to keep moving!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.90,0:13:43.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now please, for the love of\NGod, don't shoot that gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.46,0:13:52.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everybody get down!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.24,0:14:01.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.42,0:14:02.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, I see it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.98,0:14:06.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bash, the stampede is right over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.40,0:14:08.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bingo!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.10,0:14:10.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was so easy!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.76,0:14:11.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Almost too easy!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.12,0:14:14.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you down after only one shot?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.54,0:14:15.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's funny!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.62,0:14:16.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is so funny!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.32,0:14:25.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.36,0:14:27.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where was Vash the Stampede?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.88,0:14:32.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.80,0:14:33.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.68,0:14:50.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.90,0:14:53.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Devil's Helper who single-handedly
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.24,0:14:55.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,reduced a city of one\Nmillion people to ashes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.32,0:15:00.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The legendary outlaw Vash the\NStampede is just over that hill.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.84,0:15:23.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That can't...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.84,0:15:24.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.14,0:15:33.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My, my, that's more like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.04,0:15:36.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.44,0:15:38.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't there something\Nwrong with this picture?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.60,0:15:40.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They must know that man can't be him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.64,0:15:44.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vash the Stampede is a horrible fiend.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.84,0:15:47.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you get in his way,\Nhe can destroy cities.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.86,0:15:51.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And he can get out of the\Nworst situations imaginable.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.56,0:15:57.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if he's up against a thousand men,\Nhe'd find a way to emerge without a scratch.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.02,0:15:59.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.93,0:16:00.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that's who...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.85,0:16:03.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What now, Vash the Stampede?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.70,0:16:09.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's him, Vash the Stampede.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.76,0:16:14.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the matter, buddy boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.64,0:16:15.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you chickening out?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.20,0:16:29.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, aren't you a nice guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.80,0:16:38.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, time's up, Wonder Boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.86,0:16:41.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Throw the fear of death into him, Gofsef.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.16,0:16:51.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chairman, that damn\NNebraska's a loose cannon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.64,0:16:53.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, I didn't\Nwant anyone to get hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.00,0:16:55.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.60,0:17:09.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ugh, I can't believe you both\Nare still alive and well!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.58,0:17:14.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was kinda hoping you ditch the\Nwoman and save your own skin!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.68,0:17:15.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dash wouldn't do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.86,0:17:17.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He isn't that kind of person!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.54,0:17:22.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come to think of it...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.50,0:17:30.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you won't kill no matter what, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.80,0:17:34.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are disgusting!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.38,0:17:35.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know what, Vast?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.64,0:17:37.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're nothing but a damn hypocrite!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.80,0:17:43.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way you haven't had to kill\Ntroublemakers somewhere along the line!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.84,0:17:45.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do I know?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.34,0:17:49.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because nobody can survive what you've\Nbeen through without hurting somebody!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.96,0:17:54.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The sixty billion double dollar\Nbounty on your head is proof of that!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.72,0:18:00.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, what do you have to say\Nfor yourself, Vash the Stampede?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.40,0:18:04.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why won't he say anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.68,0:18:07.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why is he just standing there\Ntaking that kind of abuse?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.42,0:18:09.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.88,0:18:16.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.40,0:18:26.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're finally ready to fight, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.24,0:18:29.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, so you want to draw.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.12,0:18:32.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's pointless no matter\Nwhat caliber pistol you use,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.96,0:18:36.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,like trying to stop a car from\Nramming at 120 miles an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.78,0:18:38.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You felt it twice already.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.44,0:18:42.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even your puny brain can realize my son's\Nfist is a force to be reckoned with,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.12,0:18:44.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,or do you really believe\Nyou'll survive another one?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.80,0:18:46.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is your last chance to run?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.98,0:18:48.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Although no matter how fast you are,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.06,0:18:52.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,within the next few minutes you'll\Nbe smashed into tiny pieces.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.38,0:18:54.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now pay attention,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.80,0:18:56.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,because as a courtesy I'm going to lecture
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.66,0:18:59.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you on just what a stupid\Nfool you really are.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.40,0:19:00.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Using this technique.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.66,0:19:06.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My human mincemeat special course.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.42,0:19:08.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go help them, quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.14,0:19:13.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enjoy being a hero for a moment,\Nthen die in a most humiliating way.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.12,0:20:09.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.00,0:20:11.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It changed course.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.96,0:20:13.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was great.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.14,0:20:21.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He caused my son's fist to be off course\Nwith six little bullets. Not quite, Doc.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.40,0:20:27.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have one left, could be my special one.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.40,0:20:38.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.88,0:20:49.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was terrible!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.86,0:20:51.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.26,0:20:52.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you see what he did?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.46,0:20:53.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He really beat him!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.80,0:20:55.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And he did it with only six bullets!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.90,0:20:56.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unbelievable!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.60,0:21:04.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Suddenly it's become very clear to me\Nwhy he is called the Humanoid Typhoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.34,0:21:07.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's actually him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.72,0:21:08.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's for real.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.94,0:21:10.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The legendary outlaw.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.44,0:21:12.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bash the Stampede!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.92,0:21:14.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.24,0:21:20.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's nice of you guys to say that,\Nbut I'm no more amazing than you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.32,0:21:22.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It ain't over yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.64,0:21:26.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What? What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.94,0:21:30.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's twice you've saved me today.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.52,0:21:31.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.56,0:21:33.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't ignore me, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.26,0:21:38.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't think you won, even for a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.40,0:21:39.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's call it quits already.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.76,0:21:46.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all now, this land is\Nmade of love and peace! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.04,0:21:58.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Love and peace!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.98,0:22:00.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is he doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.90,0:22:03.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on now, you gotta\Nwrite the company reports!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.40,0:22:04.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.48,0:22:06.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Love and peace!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.50,0:22:08.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,M. Stryfe Company report,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.92,0:22:13.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,four months and 12 days after receiving\Nour orders for the insurance investigation,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.58,0:22:18.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we achieved contact with our\Ntarget, the man called Vash.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.82,0:22:24.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Contact with our target, the\Nman simply known as Vash the...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.14,0:22:25.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Love and Peace!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.50,0:22:28.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, make it go away!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.82,0:22:30.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't stand anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.46,0:22:32.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now everybody, join along!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.68,0:22:34.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Love and Peace!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.40,0:22:49.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.98,0:23:46.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.48,0:23:50.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.84,0:24:12.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The longer one holds onto a memory,\Nthe longer one lives in the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.72,0:24:18.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The deeper the memory they hold onto,\Nthe more beautiful the past will become.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.22,0:24:22.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The beautiful memories will\Neventually turn into hate.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.96,0:24:26.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if they look ahead, they\Nlose the ability to walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.94,0:24:30.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as the heavy chain called\Nrevenge continues to bind the heart,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.06,0:24:34.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The tears of sadness\Nwill continue to flow.

